<title>CHINA: China Jan-May coal output up 3.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May coal output up 3.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 550.70 million tonnes of coal in the first five months, up 3.3 percent from the same year-ago period, said a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau on Monday.</p>
<p>Coal output in May alone was 121.88 million tonnes, the report said, but did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
